  "translation": "Suka ce masa, \"Wani mutum ya haura don haɗuwa da mu, ya kuma ce mana, 'Ku tafi, ku koma wurin sarkin da ya aiku ku, ku kuma yi magana da shi: Hakika Yahweh ya ce, Shin ba don babu Elohim a cikin Isra'ila ba ne kake aikawa don bincika a Ba'al-Zevuv, gumarkin Ekron? Saboda haka, daga wannan gado da ka haura zuwa gare shi, ba za ka sauko ba, domin lallai za ka mutu.'\"",
